{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Squid Chess?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Squid Chess</strong></i> is a fast-paced real-time chess-based  cast'em'up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new chess pieces, upgrade them, and enchant them with a diverse array of magical potions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the chess-playing Squids of the distant future in some kind of a magical death-match. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save them from the Nightmare.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Real-time Chess-based game-play</i>. No more waiting for your turn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four hand-crafted worlds!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+</strong> chess pieces!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25+</strong> upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+</strong> hand-crafted battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many, many magical potions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future,  Squids play chess, and you are a vile alchemist. No, they do not play so-called 'regulation chess', they are <i>Squids</i>. The rules were made to be broken!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924670?t=1759648695","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924670/299ae9b5e636b5b1a56d6f3a5784e6b06b262a6a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759648695","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924670/af973fed25fa38069d1228b3d4c2ab5036f7ebca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759648695","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924670/af973fed25fa38069d1228b3d4c2ab5036f7ebca/caps